# --relative: lint-staged resolves absolute paths by default (lib/generateTasks.js).
# On Windows, prettier/eslint are invoked through cmd.exe (required to spawn .cmd
# shims), which caps the command line at 8191 chars. With this repo's absolute
# path prefix (~65 chars, itself containing a space that forces quoting on every
# argument), a commit touching ~80 files already exceeds that limit. Relative
# paths remove both the prefix and the quoting, at negligible risk since no
# tracked path in this repo contains a space.
npx lint-staged --relative
